    │ Note 2: a term written out inside a branch (an explicit argument, or a type you wrote) isn't refined by the `match`: only the goal and the variables in scope are, so it still has the scrutinee in it. Write `_` for such an argument, so it is inferred from the hypothesis (docs/syntax.md, "Proving things about a definition with an inner `match`")
